---
title: Error codes
description: What each error code in GGE Command means and how to fix it, from sign-in problems to bot errors.
---

Something went wrong? Search this page for the code or for the words in the message. Each entry shows what the app told you and what to do next.

## Errors from the app {% #app-errors %}

These show up as a red message in the app, next to the thing you just tried.

{% errors source="app" /%}

## Errors from your bot {% #bot-errors %}

These show on an account card or in an alert, when the bot cannot start or has to stop.

{% errors source="bot" /%}
